<section class="sec" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rev"><p class="eyebrow">Good questions</p><h2>Before you tap buy.</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="q rev"><button>What size should I pick? <span class="ch">+</span></button><div class="a"><p>Our sizes run true to age with a relaxed, roomy fit — that's intentional, kids move. If your child is between sizes or you want a second season out of it, size up. Sizes run 4–5 through 9–10 years with a relaxed, roomy fit — that's intentional, kids move. If your child is between sizes, or you want a second season out of it, size up.</p></div></div>
      <div class="q rev"><button>Will the embroidery survive the washing machine? <span class="ch">+</span></button><div class="a"><p>Yes. It's real thread stitched into the weave, not a print stuck on top — so there's nothing to crack or peel. Cold machine wash, inside out, mild detergent, dry flat in shade. That's it.</p></div></div>
